# Database Schema: Patients Table

**Database:** PostgreSQL
**Table:** patients

| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary key |
| first_name | VARCHAR(100) | Patient first name |
| last_name | VARCHAR(100) | Patient last name |
| date_of_birth | DATE | Patient date of birth |
| mrn | VARCHAR(50) | Medical record number |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | Record creation timestamp |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | Record update timestamp |

## Indexes

- Primary key on `id`
- Unique index on `mrn`
- Index on `last_name` for search performance
